{"ID":"20240307155325-xktcwb7","Spec":"2","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"id":"20240307155325-xktcwb7","scroll":"\u0026#123;\u0026quot;rootId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240307155325-xktcwb7\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;startId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240312161008-j0gt0mp\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;endId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240312161008-swc4t2z\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;scrollTop\u0026quot;:0,\u0026quot;focusId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240312161008-2qpv6wm\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;focusStart\u0026quot;:19,\u0026quot;focusEnd\u0026quot;:19\u0026#125;","title":"【栀子蘗皮汤】（栀子柏皮汤）","type":"doc","updated":"20240312161008"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240312161008-j0gt0mp","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312161008-j0gt0mp","updated":"20240312161008"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"第二百七十五条。"}]},{"ID":"20240312161008-gk2dv4a","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312161008-gk2dv4a","updated":"20240312161008"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"原文：伤寒」瘀热在里，身必发黄，「栀子蘗皮汤」主之。"}]},{"ID":"20240312161008-tkin12f","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312161008-tkin12f","updated":"20240312161008"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"茵陈篙汤和栀子蘗皮汤，茵陈篙汤是有湿热实。栀子蘗皮汤没有表症，淤热在里，没有实症，大便很通畅，只是里面有淤热。"}]},{"ID":"20240312161008-hnw3e8z","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312161008-hnw3e8z","style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);","updated":"20240312161008"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"parent-style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);","style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"栀子蘗皮汤方"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\" parent-style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240312161008-xdytbqa","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312161008-xdytbqa","style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);","updated":"20240312161008"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"parent-style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);","style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"栀子十五个擘。甘草一两炙。黄柏二两。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\" parent-style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240312161008-dkacfvj","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312161008-dkacfvj","style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);","updated":"20240312161008"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"parent-style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);","style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"右三味，以水四升，煮取一升半，去滓，分温再服。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\" parent-style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240312161008-5t0y88q","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312161008-5t0y88q","updated":"20240312161008"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"栀子上焦的热，黄柏下焦热，中焦因为没有湿，处方就没有了，用甘草湿很盛的时候小便不利，因为堵在里面，小便排不出来。临床，只要有湿的人舌苔都会很厚，很粘，燥症舌苔干掉了。"}]},{"ID":"20240312161008-hnys888","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312161008-hnys888","updated":"20240312161008"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"黄柏能去下焦的热，小便痛，肾脏痛，里面只要"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"发热发炎"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"都会用到黄柏。"}]},{"ID":"20240312161008-cllndsu","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312161008-cllndsu","updated":"20240312161008"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"实物上栀子蘗皮汤可以做眼科的洗剂，洗眼用的。洗眼睛不要煮太浓，用棉布洗眼睛，眼科发炎，角膜炎都可以用。"}]},{"ID":"20240312161008-m1blyme","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312161008-m1blyme","style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);","updated":"20240312161008"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"parent-style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);","style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"在伤寒里面一共三个方子，治疗全身发黄发高热者："},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\" parent-style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240312161008-j3vf9hf","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312161008-j3vf9hf","style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);","updated":"20240312161008"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"parent-style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);","style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"1、无汗，病人没有汗的时候，用麻黄连翘赤小豆汤。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\" parent-style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240312161008-z4nr9ll","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312161008-z4nr9ll","style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);","updated":"20240312161008"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"parent-style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);","style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"2、病人有汗且实热在里，就是茵陈蒿汤。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\" parent-style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240312161008-2qpv6wm","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312161008-2qpv6wm","style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);","updated":"20240312161008"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"parent-style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);","style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"3、无表证无里实而身发黄，栀子蘗皮汤。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\" parent-style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240312161008-swc4t2z","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312161008-swc4t2z","updated":"20240312161008"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"栀子蘗皮汤剂量是栀子三，炙甘草一，黄柏三，栀子和黄柏剂量一样，能够去热的药，药性都比较寒凉，寒凉药都会比较苦一点。"}]}]}